       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. Q8-LOAN.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-PRINCIPAL PIC 9(9)V99.
       01 WS-MONTHS PIC 999.
       01 WS-MONTHLY PIC 9(9)V99.
       01 WS-OUT PIC Z(9)9.99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "ENTER LOAN PRINCIPAL:".
           ACCEPT WS-PRINCIPAL.
           DISPLAY "ENTER NUMBER OF MONTHS:".
           ACCEPT WS-MONTHS.
           IF WS-MONTHS <= 0
               DISPLAY "INVALID INPUT"
           ELSE
               COMPUTE WS-MONTHLY = WS-PRINCIPAL / WS-MONTHS
               MOVE WS-MONTHLY TO WS-OUT
               DISPLAY "MONTHLY REPAYMENT: " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-OUT)
           END-IF.
           STOP RUN.
       